			<div class="forum_comment_action_menu" style="display: none;" id="forum_comment_actions_menu_572679173080114519">				<a class="forum_comment_action report tooltip" href="javascript:Forum_ShowReportDialog( '103582791475798685', '590692129307765155', '572679173080109213', '8530547', '572679173080114519' );" data-tooltip-text="Report this post for inappropriate content.  Reported post are flagged for review by moderators.">
				<span class="non_breaking_space">&nbsp;</span><img src="https://community.akamai.steamstatic.com/public/images/skin_1/notification_icon_flag_dark.png?v=1">Report this post</a>
			</div>
							</div>
			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_572679173080114519">
				3 out of 4 of my games were released before AI could code at all. And, AI Roguelite released even before ChatGPT was invented.<br><br>So this game is my first &quot;AI slop&quot; game if you want to call it that, and it is far more polished than the stuff I could make in the same amount of time, so I don't think it's realistic to hope less people use it.			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
