				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b>Painfully Unmagic</b>:</div>That this &quot;dev&quot; already is pumping out their third AI-slop title is frightening. If nothing changes soon, we won't be able to sift through all the trash being dumped on the store. </blockquote>Seems unfair.			</div>
