			</div>
							</div>
			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_572679173080117280">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b>Painfully Unmagic</b>:</div>That this &quot;dev&quot; already is pumping out their third AI-slop title is frightening. If nothing changes soon, we won't be able to sift through all the trash being dumped on the store. </blockquote><br>Games that use AI != AI slop.<br><br>As they already said, they released titles before AI could even code, the core of this game is having an AI gamemaster similar to titles like AIdventure or AI2U.<br><br>The fact is that this game is doing something unique in the space. At worst, it's a minimum viable product or tech demo, which is fine for Early Access. AI slop is any one of the dozen needle in a haystack games.			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
									<div></div>
				
				
